04:08.960 --> 04:10.780
Semuanya, bertahanlah!

04:14.560 --> 04:16.050
Bantai Sekte Duxian!

04:16.360 --> 04:17.250
Serbu!

04:32.270 --> 04:33.540
Pasukan Klan Siluman,

04:33.560 --> 04:35.020
